{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SessionKey","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24","fileName":"SessionKey.swift"},"externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO","symbolKind":"enum"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the session an event was tracked in: a random identifier that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"code":"Sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") sets on every record’s context."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Records","title":"Records","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SourceLocation","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:"}]},{"code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a new identifier."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":": once its whole segment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the only part of a record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it apart from a record."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","